   2303  7081							; Display Data
   2304  7081							;----------------------------------------
   2305  7081							; The Display Data bank is copied into RAM when DPC+ initializes the cartridge.
   2306  7081							; This allows us to manipulate the data during run-time, but have a known
   2307  7081							; starting state when the Atari is first turned on.
   2308  7081							;
   2309  7081							; Unlike normal Atari VCS/2600 sprite definitions, the sprite data in the
   2310  7081							; Display Data bank is stored right-side-up.
